``` SR-10 | Users Blocked by Search Disk Quota or Concurrency Limits
    Splunk Administrator Field Manual - Gaurav Malik

    Use case: Users report searches refusing to run with quota errors;
    identify which users are hitting srchDiskQuota or srchJobsQuota and how
    much of the quota they are using.
    Run on: SH, and SH-local for current disk use.
    Query: Current dispatch disk use per user (SH-local)
    STATUS: lab verification pending; field or message names may differ on your version.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/search/jobs count=0
| stats count as jobs round(sum(eval(diskUsage / 1024 / 1024)), 1) as disk_mb
        by author
| sort - disk_mb
